## Why This Is Asked

Tests the ability to respond to SAP-specific security incidents with cross-account trust, emergency privilege handling, and auditable containment across Prod, Shared, and DR environments.

## Key Concepts

- Automated incident response using Security Hub, Step Functions, and Lambda
- Emergency cross-account roles with MFA enforcement
- SAP HANA on EC2 access control with STS-based JIT (Just-In-Time) privilege elevation
- Key management via KMS with automated rotation strategies
- Network containment using security groups and PrivateLink with end-to-end auditability

